# Licensing

- Keep firmware (SeaBIOS, OVMF, etc.) under `firmware/` with build scripts and license notices.
- Update `third_party/NOTICE` when adding third-party binaries or substantial code.
- Record provenance in `docs/sources.md` and `docs/licensing.md`.
- Do not vendor GPL sources into MIT/Apache crates without an explicit license decision recorded in an ADR.
- Do not paste code from other emulator projects regardless of license ambiguity.
